# When was the Eiffel Tower finished?
subtitle: "Guess the year the Eiffel Tower was finished, then hear how a tower built to last twenty years, and hated by artists, was saved by radio."

## When was the Eiffel Tower finished?
text: {"font_size":36}
sources:
    - id: te
      title: How radio saved the Eiffel Tower from destruction
      authors: Société d'Exploitation de la Tour Eiffel (official site)
      year: 2019
      url: https://www.toureiffel.paris/en/news/130-years/why-was-eiffel-tower-kept
      finding: built for the 1889 Exposition Universelle on a 20-year permit; kept after 1909 because of its use as a radio antenna
    - id: hist
      title: How the Eiffel Tower Was Saved From Being Demolished
      authors: History.com
      year: 2023
      url: https://www.history.com/articles/eiffel-tower-survival
      finding: artists and writers, among them Maupassant, protested in Le Temps on 14 February 1887 against the 'useless and monstrous' tower

